00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:19.620 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
Follow Testo's arrival.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.535 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
The administrator chooses the QA

00:00:22.535 --> 00:00:23.907 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
Engineer blueprint and the

00:00:23.907 --> 00:00:25.279 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
