00:01:02.825 --> 00:01:04.779 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
Testo supports QA planning.

00:01:04.779 --> 00:01:06.732 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
Browser execution needs human

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.196 line:1.5%,center position:50%,center size:88% align:center
